      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEVER SURRENDER (4) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 23.04 beating Comanche Chief. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. ROADS END (1) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh at this track, but was among the placings at Traralgon three back. Well placed here and can atone this time. ARCHIE'S GIFT (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (23.16) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Can hit the frame this time. GOT FLAIR (8) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
